    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Approach the Epic Battle Between Leo and Terius...</strong></h2><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2972650/extras/0d3de820b1dd38b98520dcce0c33ac5a.poster.avif?t=1748549812\" width=600 height=348 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2972650/extras/0d3de820b1dd38b98520dcce0c33ac5a.webm?t=1748549812\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2972650/extras/0d3de820b1dd38b98520dcce0c33ac5a.mp4?t=1748549812\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>Continue DNA in part one of the boss battle against Terius within the final episode, following the journey of Leo where he has finally arrived at the rooftops of Nova Corp.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2972650/extras/fc616b8b9d55ffd2dda1a16c2912c45f.avif?t=1748549812\" width=616 height=308 /></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Experience the Epic Showdown Between Ultimate Power...</strong></h2><br><i><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Fight a boss battle unlike you have ever fought before...<br><br></li><li>Play through rewarding challenges fueled by vengeance.<br><br></li><li> Clash with darkness and discover the fate of the world...</li></ul></i><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2972650/extras/84299fa52d351983d3276207a524fa3c.avif?t=1748549812\" width=616 height=308 /></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Battle the True Evil Within Terius...</strong></h2><br><i><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Pick back up this episode with DNA's epic 2D Beat'em up gameplay!<br><br></li><li>Experience a challenging gameplay formula building upon last season's rewarding difficulties.<br><br></li><li> Take Terius head on in part one of the epic showdown...</li></ul></i><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2972650/extras/fc3fa68fb3268a703c18ea705e4b8ce0.avif?t=1748549812\" width=616 height=308 /></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Clash with the Heart of Darkness.</strong></h2><br><i><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Watch as the story develops further into intriguing events in part one of the final episode of DNA.<br><br></li><li> Engage in battle with Terius to avenge all of the scars left by his hatred towards mankind.<br><br></li><li> Find out if Leo has the strength to defeat Terius on the next episode. </li></ul></i>",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Approach the Epic Battle Between Leo and Terius...</strong></h2><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2972650/extras/0d3de820b1dd38b98520dcce0c33ac5a.poster.avif?t=1748549812\" width=600 height=348 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2972650/extras/0d3de820b1dd38b98520dcce0c33ac5a.webm?t=1748549812\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2972650/extras/0d3de820b1dd38b98520dcce0c33ac5a.mp4?t=1748549812\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>Continue DNA in part one of the boss battle against Terius within the final episode, following the journey of Leo where he has finally arrived at the rooftops of Nova Corp.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2972650/extras/fc616b8b9d55ffd2dda1a16c2912c45f.avif?t=1748549812\" width=616 height=308 /></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Experience the Epic Showdown Between Ultimate Power...</strong></h2><br><i><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Fight a boss battle unlike you have ever fought before...<br><br></li><li>Play through rewarding challenges fueled by vengeance.<br><br></li><li> Clash with darkness and discover the fate of the world...</li></ul></i><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2972650/extras/84299fa52d351983d3276207a524fa3c.avif?t=1748549812\" width=616 height=308 /></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Battle the True Evil Within Terius...</strong></h2><br><i><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Pick back up this episode with DNA's epic 2D Beat'em up gameplay!<br><br></li><li>Experience a challenging gameplay formula building upon last season's rewarding difficulties.<br><br></li><li> Take Terius head on in part one of the epic showdown...</li></ul></i><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2972650/extras/fc3fa68fb3268a703c18ea705e4b8ce0.avif?t=1748549812\" width=616 height=308 /></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Clash with the Heart of Darkness.</strong></h2><br><i><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Watch as the story develops further into intriguing events in part one of the final episode of DNA.<br><br></li><li> Engage in battle with Terius to avenge all of the scars left by his hatred towards mankind.<br><br></li><li> Find out if Leo has the strength to defeat Terius on the next episode. </li></ul></i>",
